# This file defines the owners for every directory in the repository.
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Syntax:
# - Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners (teams or @users).
# - The last matching pattern takes precedence.
# - Wildcards and directory patterns are supported.
# - Teams are referenced as @org/team-name.
# - Users are referenced as @username.

# Global owners for fallback
